  "description": "<p>We have used Fedora in class names without a lot of clarity, for example</p>\n\n<p>In fcrepo-kernel-api we have the following models.</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>FedoraBinary</li>\n\t<li>FedoraResource</li>\n\t<li>FedoraTimeMap</li>\n\t<li>FedoraWebacAcl</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>but also</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Container</li>\n\t<li>Tombstone</li>\n\t<li>NonRdfSourceDescription</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>This ticket is to refactor the Fedora out of class names unless there is another heavily used class with an overlapping name. ie. Jena Resource</p>",
